@startuml GuestLanding
' --- DIAGRAM METADATA ---
title "Sequence Diagram: Guest Lands on Home Page"

' --- PARTICIPANTS ---
actor Guest
participant "Frontend (Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "Backend (FastAPI)" as Backend

' --- FLOW OF EVENTS ---
Guest -> Frontend: Navigates to Home Page (/)
activate Frontend

par 
    Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/users/me
    activate Backend
    
    alt User is NOT Authenticated (Guest)
        Backend --> Frontend: 401 Unauthorized
    else User IS Authenticated
        Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK [User Object]
    end
    deactivate Backend

else

    Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/subjects/top
    activate Backend
    Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK [List of Subjects]
    deactivate Backend
    
else

    Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/guides/top
    activate Backend
    Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK [List of Guides]
    deactivate Backend
end

Frontend --> Guest: Renders Home Page with content and conditional UI
deactivate Frontend

@enduml